msgid "As shown, the GPS and Telemetry connections are compatible with the serial port defaults loaded when the firmware for the Matek autopilot is programmed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:143
#: f8a4c38eea034490b9b85932006b73db
msgid "The SERVOx_FUNCTIONS will have to be set such that the following is assigned:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:146
